1
00:00:05,979 --> 00:00:10,000
That's your mom.

2
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,360
So what'd you do before the world ended?

3
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:26,020
I was kissing my wife, playing with my dog.

4
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:29,940
I'm wondering every day how I got so lucky.

5
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:35,060
You gotta have something to haunt you, right?

6
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,220
Otherwise you might get lonely.

7
00:00:43,899 --> 00:00:47,980
We have no idea what's out there.
What do you expect to find?

8
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:53,040
The world as it was doesn't exist.

9
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:58,280
It's just us trying to hold on to what was.

10
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:01,300
Everyone else...

11
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,160
This world fits you, man.

12
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:11,880
Wake up, defend, survive.

13
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:16,100
There's gotta be something better than this.

14
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:16,660
The dream?

15
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,320
Can we help him?

16
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:37,840
We have a lot to lose.

17
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:44,140
I don't like the feeling of wondering
whether or not you're going to come back.

18
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,260
It takes a lot of faith to keep searching.

19
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,420
Get back!
